met_44a9ae.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Slayer\"><img alt=\"Dragon Slayer\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_Slayer_9866f8.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Magma Legs\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Magma_Legs_f27249.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord%20Trophy\"><img alt=\"Dragon Lord Trophy\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_Lord_Trophy_23028d.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Updates%2F9.60\">9.60</a><br/>July 11, 2012<br/>Summer Update 2012</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>Through one the <a href=\"#/wiki/Large%20Crystal%20Teleporter\">Crystal Teleporters</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomebase%20Alpha\">Gnomebase Alpha</a>. You will face <a href=\"#/wiki/Massive%20Fire%20Elemental\">Massive Fire Elementals</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lords</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Vulcongra\">Vulcongras</a>. This is the most dangerous of the regular five hunting areas in <a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomegate\">Gnomegate</a>. \n</p><p><b>Knights:</b> If solo hunting here only lure 3 to 4 monsters at a time and be ready to use health potions as the <a href=\"#/wiki/Vulcongra\">Vulcongras</a> beams are very strong and can combo out a knight very easily. Highly recommend duo with a druid for larger pulls and more experience. Try to avoid having multiple <a href=\"#/wiki/Vulcongra\">Vulcongras</a> able to beam you in the lure.   \n</p><p><b>Mages:</b> Would not recommend hunting here solo at the level 90 suggestion, go with a knight and use magma set with avalanche runes. Avoid the beams of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Vulcongra\">Vulcongras</a> and the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lords</a> as well as the area damage caused by all monsters here. \n</p><p><b>Paladins:</b> Would not recommend hunting here as you cannot lure as many as a knight solo and you cannot run the monsters killing them 1 by 1 as there is always more monsters nearby. If hunt here avoid beams from <a href=\"#/wiki/Vulcongra\">Vulcongras</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lords</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100p